{
  "$mulmocast": { "version": "1.1" },
  "lang": "ja",
  "title": "Talking avatar over slides",
  "description": "Needs mesh-avatar-studio checked out next to this repository (for its sample avatar), and npm packages avatarscript and onnxruntime-node.",
  "avatarParams": { "position": { "x": "82%", "y": "100%", "scale": "62%" } },
  "speechParams": {
    "speakers": {
      "Miko": {
        "provider": "openai",
        "voiceId": "coral",
        "displayName": { "ja": "ミコ" },
        "avatar": { "source": "../../../mesh-avatar-studio/samples/miko-qipao" }
      }
    }
  },
  "beats": [
    {
      "speaker": "Miko",
      "text": "みなさん、こんにちは！今日は、スライドの上でしゃべるアバターを紹介します。",
      "image": { "type": "markdown", "markdown": ["# Talking avatars", "", "- MulmoScript + AvatarScript", "- スライドの上でアバターが話す"] },
      "avatarParams": { "emotion": "happy", "motions": [{ "motion": "nod", "at": "こんにちは" }] }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miko",
      "text": "位置と大きさは、台本全体で決めておいて、ビートごとに変えられます。このスライドでは、大きくなっています。",
      "image": { "type": "markdown", "markdown": ["# Position and size", "", "- 台本全体: `avatarParams.position`", "- ビートごとに上書き"] },
      "avatarParams": { "emotion": "relaxed", "position": { "x": "76%", "scale": "82%" }, "motions": [{ "motion": "tilt", "at": "大きく" }] }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miko",
      "text": "こちらでは、左側に小さく移動しました。",
      "image": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "markdown": ["# Moved", "", "```json", "\"avatarParams\": {", "  \"position\": { \"x\": \"18%\", \"scale\": \"48%\" }", "}", "```"]
      },
      "avatarParams": { "emotion": "surprised", "position": { "x": "18%", "scale": "48%" }, "motions": [{ "motion": "surprise" }] }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Miko",
      "text": "最後は、元の位置に戻ります。それでは、始めましょう！",
      "image": { "type": "markdown", "markdown": ["# Let's start"] },
      "avatarParams": { "emotion": "happy" }
    }
  ]
}
